  "blocks": {
    "reference--body-0": {
      "id": "reference--body-0",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "reference--body-0--text",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Presmium 的可编辑文稿、运行快照与插件契约具有不同的版本边界。集成时先确认自己读写的是哪一层，再检查安装版本与公开类型。完整接口签名由导航栏的 API 从源码生成。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "versions--body-0": {
      "id": "versions--body-0",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "versions--body-0--text",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "包版本标识已安装实现。DOCUMENT_SCHEMA_VERSION 和文稿的 schemaVersion 标识可编辑格式。IR_VERSION 和快照的 ir 标识运行快照格式。KERNEL_VERSION 标识插件契约，不能用其中一个版本替代其他层的检查。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "versions-packages--body-0": {
      "id": "versions-packages--body-0",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "versions-packages--body-0--text",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "工程通过 package.json 和 pnpm 锁文件固定依赖。插件声明它实际使用的宿主、内核和编译器对等依赖范围。不满足范围的插件不会被当成可用能力，检查命令会说明原因。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "versions-packages--body-1": {
      "id": "versions-packages--body-1",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "versions-packages--body-1--text",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "使用发布版本提供的 exports 和 TypeScript 声明。文档中的任务示例不能取代安装版本的命令帮助与契约。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "versions-ir--body-0": {
      "id": "versions-ir--body-0",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "versions-ir--body-0--text",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "当前可编辑文稿使用 schemaVersion: 1，入口为 lecture.json。共同校验器检查实体 ID、引用、内容树、参数状态和媒体范围。它不接受旧 MyST 源码作为运行输入。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "versions-ir--body-1": {
      "id": "versions-ir--body-1",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "versions-ir--body-1--text",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "运行 IRDocument 是编译结果，包含解析后的步号、状态、资源和诊断。渲染端只读它；编辑器、agent 和工作区事务读写 TeachingDocument，不能从快照反造另一个权威正文。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "versions-kernel--body-0": {
      "id": "versions-kernel--body-0",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "versions-kernel--body-0--text",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Node 与浏览器插件声明兼容的 kernel 范围。插件和宿主共用一份契约与服务运行时；兼容范围不足、实现缺失或服务不可用时保留明确诊断。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "public--body-0": {
      "id": "public--body-0",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "public--body-0--text",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "@lincyaw/kernel 提供文稿、运行快照、插件和服务契约；@lincyaw/host 提供浏览器宿主 hooks 与服务；@lincyaw/compiler 提供编译和构建接口；@lincyaw/viewer 提供运行快照的视图扩展。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "public--body-1": {
      "id": "public--body-1",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "public--body-1--text",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "只导入包声明的公开路径，不依赖编译产物目录、私有实现、编辑器私有状态或另一个插件的内部代码。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "public-documents--body-0": {
      "id": "public-documents--body-0",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "public-documents--body-0--text",
          "type": "code",
          "language": "sh",
          "value": "presmium --help\npresmium check --help\npresmium build --help\npresmium serve --help"
        }
      ]
    },
    "public-documents--body-1": {
      "id": "public-documents--body-1",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "public-documents--body-1--text",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "工作区配置是 presmium.workspace.yaml，documents 模式只列 lecture.json。凭据与运营者设置和文稿内容分开。源码、保存版本、快照版本与音频缓存版本分别确认，旧响应不能冒充当前版本。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "public-contracts--body-0": {
      "id": "public-contracts--body-0",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "public-contracts--body-0--text",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "validateDocument、DOCUMENT_JSON_SCHEMA 与 TeachingDocument 是 Web、agent、直接文件编辑和编译器共用的作者契约。工作区更改携带 baseDocumentVersion；冲突保留输入，不静默覆盖另一个版本。工作区 MCP 先用 get_authoring_capabilities 探测，再通过 get_document、plan_document_change、apply_document_change 读取、预检与提交；回执区分已保存和未请求的编译／运行验证。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "public-contracts--body-1": {
      "id": "public-contracts--body-1",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "public-contracts--body-1--text",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "诊断包含稳定检查 ID、严重程度与定位信息。编译失败允许保留最后成功快照，但界面必须说明它已经过期，不能将它作为当前文稿的确认回执。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "experimental-workbench--body-0": {
      "id": "experimental-workbench--body-0",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "experimental-workbench--body-0--text",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "工作台和私有服务路由可能随产品实现调整。外部插件优先使用宿主与服务契约，确需实验性接口时固定安装版本并真实验证。父页面正文编辑、独立编译放映和视频制作遵守各自的内容与生命周期边界。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "experimental-workbench--body-1": {
      "id": "experimental-workbench--body-1",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "experimental-workbench--body-1--text",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "写文稿见"
            },
            {
              "type": "link",
              "href": "../guide/lecture.json",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "作者指南"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "，实现扩展见插件开发指南。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
